.Dd October 27, 2026
.Dt BTOP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm btop
.Nd resource monitor that shows usage and stats for processor, memory, disks, network, and processes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl c Ar file
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl f Ar filter
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl p Ar id
.Op Fl t
.Op Fl u Ar ms
.Op Fl -force-utf
.Op Fl -themes-dir Ar dir
.Nm
.Op Fl -default-config | Fl h | Fl V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a program that shows usage and stats for processor, memory, disks,
network, and processes.
.Pp
The program follows the usual GNU command line syntax, with long options
starting with two dashes.
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl c , Fl -config Ar file
Path to a config file.
.It Fl d , Fl -debug
Start in debug mode with additional logs and metrics.
.It Fl f , Fl -filter Ar filter
Set an initial process filter.
.It Fl -force-utf
Force start even if no UTF-8 locale was detected.
.It Fl l , Fl -low-color
Disable true color, 256 colors only.
.It Fl p , Fl -preset Ar id
Start with a preset (0-9).
.It Fl t , Fl -tty
Force tty mode with ANSI graph symbols and 16 colors only.
.It Fl -no-tty
Force disable tty mode.
.It Fl -themes-dir Ar dir
Path to a custom themes directory.
When specified, this directory takes priority over the default theme
search paths.
.It Fl u , Fl -update Ar ms
Set an initial update rate in milliseconds.
.It Fl -default-config
Print default config to standard output.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show summary of options.
.It Fl V , Fl -version
Show version of program.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent -compact
.It Pa ~/.config/btop/btop.conf
the configuration
.It Pa ~/.config/btop/themes
the user's themes
.It Pa /usr/share/btop/themes
the themes that come with
.Nm
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ps 1 ,
.Xr top 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.Nm
was written by
.An Jakob P. Liljenberg
a.k.a.\& "Aristocratos".
.Sh BUGS
The upstream bug tracker can be found at
.Lk https://github.com/aristocratos/btop/issues .
On Minkar,
.Nm
has no GPU panel, and its sensors are those of Intel Macs (SMC).
